Z||000000||TheHans||01-22-2001||01:46 AM||||I got home late last night after a night of  long islands and cheap beer.<BR>I had a dream (non-hydrated)<BR>of a brand new Pontiac Fiero<BR>I saw the whole commercial in my head. It was awesome with a car doing a 360 burnout and then zoom to closeup. And in an Anthony Hopkins voice I heard <BR>"The 2001 Pontiac Fiero"<BR>Anyone else have Fiero dreams?||||reg||10
Z||000001||80's BOY||01-22-2001||01:59 PM||||it's pretty screwed up. the other night i dreamed that someone disassembled my engine again. i opened up the deck lid and the pieces were all sitting there in a pile. a few months ago i dreamed that my intake was full of marshmallows when i pulled off the plenum. yeah, i told you it was pretty screwed up.||||reg||14
Z||000002||RiceCooker||01-22-2001||02:36 PM||||Lately I have been having lots of fiero dreams. Mostly cause I think about it so much. I'll just be driving and listening to tunes, then i'll stomp on it and hear the roar of the exhaust behind me!<P>When I wake up I feel great, then I remember my car is away for the winter and I start to cry.||||reg||13
Z||000003||Tigger||01-22-2001||02:55 PM||||I had one that was <I>way out there</I> probably about couple months ago.<P>It was almost a Mad Max kind of setting, but inside a dark city.  I lived above a small abandoned greasy repair shop, and kept my Fiero parked in the service bay.  For some reason the shop was like one of the best places to be in at the time because car parts and tools were in short order.  It was funny because everything in the shop was dark and dingy except for my Fiero.  I had retrofitted it with most of the high tech stuff that was available at the time.<P>The rest of what I remember is too sketchy to explain, but it was sweet.  Took me a few minutes to regain my marbles and figure out it was a dream because it seemed so real.  I like those types of dreams the most.||||reg||1
Z||000004||pred1tor83||01-23-2001||12:54 PM||||Those types of dreams can be cool but somtimes they are downright messed up. . .  especailly when you dont realize it was a dream cause it was so real.  Like if you in your dream went out with a really fine girl and she had a terible time w/ you. . . so you call her later in the day (the real one) only to find out that she had a great time . . . but you could of swore the night sucked . . .  weird <P>sorry it was off topic. . . just thought i would share some of my story lol!!!||||reg||3
