Z||000010||Cheever2||01-25-2001||09:30 PM||||I'm getting into the car after work and discover Britney You-know-who in the other seat.  She asked "Would you give me a lift to my hotel?".  So, being the gentleman that I am, I comply.  On the way, she practically got in my seat with me.  We slithered and groped and became so entwined I don't know how I was able to drive.  It took every ounce of willpower we had to maintain some civility between the car and her room.  By that time I was perspiring.  Inside, we went at each other with recless abandon.  She was a wild animal!  We finally fell asleep exhausted.  That's when the dream began.<BR><P>------------------<BR><I>Chuck Hodges</I>||||reg||6
